From: MSchwartz at MedAnalytics.com (Marc Schwartz)
Date: Tue, 04 Nov 2003 14:48:32 -0600
Subject: Re: source of computation errors
In-Reply-To: <008901c3a30f$1be58750$0419a8c0@KCCR2>
