Message-ID: <3A822319EB35174CA3714066D590DCD50205CE84@usrymx25.merck.com>

Try 
the following:

 

twonorm <- function(x, m1, s1, m2, s2) {
  dnorm(x, m1, 
s1) - dnorm(x, m2, s2)
}

findintersect <- function(m1, s1, m2, s2) {
  lower 
<- min(m1 - 2*s1, m2 - 2*s2)
  upper <- max(m1 + 2*s1, m2 + 
2*s2)
  uniroot(twonorm, interval=c(lower, 
upper),
          m1=m1, s1=s1, 
m2=m2, s2=s2)
}

 

findintersect(1, 3, 4, 
2)

You 
may need to be careful with the situation where the two normals are far apart, 
so that the difference in the "middle" is too close to 0 for a large 
interval.

 

HTH,

Andy

